# NOT all of android/. scripts/ota-bundle.mjs reads OTA_NATIVE_CONTRACT from
# android/app/build.gradle to stamp min_native into the OTA manifest, and it
# hard-fails rather than guessing — correctly, since a wrong min_native ships a
# web bundle to APKs whose native code cannot run it.
#
# Excluding the whole tree broke the deploy exactly once: the CLI uploads src/,
# so vercel-build.sh skips its tarball fetch, so build.gradle never arrived.
# Only the build outputs are excluded now — they are large, regenerated, and
# .vercelignore does not read .gitignore, so without these they would upload.
android/build
android/app/build
android/.gradle
android/app/src/main/assets/public
